      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2 class="section-title">Types of Organizations We Partner With</h2>
      <ul style="list-style-position: inside; line-height: 2;">
        <li>Early Childhood Education (ECE) programs and pre-K centers</li>
        <li>Non-profit social service organizations</li>
        <li>School districts and educational institutions</li>
        <li>Community health and wellness organizations</li>
        <li>Family support and advocacy organizations</li>
        <li>For-profit businesses committed to community impact</li>
        <li>Government agencies serving children and families</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-section">
      <h2>Interested in Partnership?</h2>
      <p style="margin: 1rem 0;">Let's explore how we can work together to advance inclusive education and support children with diverse abilities in our community.</p>
      <a href="/contact-us" class="cta-button">Start a Conversation</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  
  

